## 4. Verification Matrix

| Action | Previous Behavior | New Behavior | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |
| Click "Add Relative" from Directory | Opens modal dialog over directory | Redirects to `/user-dashboard/members/create?from=members` | Verified |
| Click "Add Relative" from Tree | Opens modal dialog over canvas | Redirects to `/user-dashboard/members/create?from=tree` | Verified |
| Cancel on Create Page | Closed modal | Navigates back cleanly to previous tab | Verified |
| Submit New Relative | Saved and closed modal | Saves to PostgreSQL and redirects back to previous tab | Verified |
| Duplicate Prevention | In-modal alert | Full-width interactive preview & link interface | Verified |
